# Evolution Layer

This layer answers: "How does {{REPO_NAME}} become more accurate and useful after each run?"

Evolution processes runtime lessons, completed outputs, owner corrections, and new evidence. It decides which material is only a one-off record and which material should update identity, memory, capabilities, roles, or work.

## Subdirectories

- `ipo/`: uses IPO Reverse to reconstruct evidence, hidden cognitive tasks, intermediate artifacts, and reusable methodology from completed outputs.

Any conclusion upgraded into a stable skill, identity judgment, or public narrative must keep its evidence boundary and owner-alignment state.
